Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.30,1:57:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《蜘蛛侠：英雄远征》
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.16,2:09:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[缅怀感激斯坦·李和史蒂夫·迪特科]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 这是很悲剧 但我们不是为此而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, this was a tragedy, but it's not why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在还负责对抗天气了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are we fighting the weather now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,本地人说龙卷风长了脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locals say the cyclone had a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,人在高压下是可能出现幻觉的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People see things when they're under stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.49,0:01:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那不代表这又是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? That does not mean that this is the start
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,重大的世界末日...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to some other big world-ending...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不想掺和进来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want any part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:03:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄已逝 永不遗忘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone, but not forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢基纳斯·林和维翰·拉玛莫斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to Kenneth Lim and Vihaan Ramamurthy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.89,0:03:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,剪辑了这段感人的致敬视频{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for their help with that touching video tribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,今年可以说是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This year has been nothing short of...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,疯狂 简直太疯狂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is crazy. It's, like, insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.69,0:03:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 杰森 - 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jason. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不许说脏话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No swearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,反正明天放假了 没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's the last day of school. We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,历史性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Historic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,五年多前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over five years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,全宇宙一半的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}half of all life in the universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,也包括我们城中高中的一半生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including our own Midtown High...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.49,0:03:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,都被抹去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was wiped from existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但八个月前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then eight months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一群勇敢的英雄把我们带了回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a band of brave heroes brought us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,此事件被称为"闪烁"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They called it "The Blip."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这些闪灭了的人 以原年龄回归了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those of us who Blipped away came back the same age...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们没有闪灭的同学们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But our classmates that didn't Blip
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,则长大了五岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had grown five years older.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我弟弟现在比我大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, like my little brother is now older than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 这是数学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's math.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管我们闪灭时 学年已过去了一半{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even though we had Blipped away halfway through the school year
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而且已经考过期中考了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and had already taken midterms,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,学校还是要求我们从头重上这个学年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the school made us start the year over from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,太不公平了 这不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's totally unfair. It's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,城中虎们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tigers...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这段旅程漫长 戏剧性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's been a long, dramatic,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.45,0:03:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还有些令人困惑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somewhat confusing road.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,随着今年即将结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As we draw this year to a close,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也该向前看了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's time to move on...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.19,0:04:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,迎来我们生命的新阶段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a new phase of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,祈祷不会再发生什么疯狂事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pray nothing crazy happens again
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,因为现在还有复仇者联盟吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because are the Avengers even like a thing anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有人有什么计划吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does anyone even have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.49,0:04:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我要在飞机上挨着MJ坐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. First, I'm gonna sit next to MJ on the flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,第二 我要买个双耳机插口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second, I'm gonna buy a dual headphone adapter
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,跟她看一路的电影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and watch movies with her the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 第三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Three,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们到了威尼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we go to Venice,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那里的玻璃制品非常有名 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Venice is super famous for making stuff out of glass right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 所以我要给她买条黑色大丽花项链{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- True. - So, I'm gonna buy her a black dahlia necklace
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她最喜欢的花就是黑色大丽花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because her favorite flower is the black dahlia
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为... - 那起谋杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- because of, well... - The murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 第四 等我们到了巴黎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The murder. Four, when we go to Paris,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我要带她登上埃菲尔铁塔顶部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take her to the top of the Eiffel Tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,把项链送她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give her the necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 第五 我要向她表白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, five, I'm gonna tell her how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 第六 希望她会说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, six, hopefully she tells me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,她对我也有一样的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she feels the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.09,0:04:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了第七步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, don't forget step seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 第七步 - 以上都别做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Step Seven. - Don't do any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.79,0:04:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们将在欧洲做单身汉 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because, we're gonna be bachelors in Europe, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 内德 - 听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ned. - Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别的我不知道 但我知道这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may not know much, but I do know this:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,欧洲人爱美国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Europeans love Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 而且半数欧洲人是女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - More than half are women.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但... 我真的很喜欢MJ 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... I really like MJ, man, okay?
