Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.32,0:25:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然给忘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you forgot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.16,0:25:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你一起作战的那人是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, who was that guy that you were with?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.89,0:25:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那是斯特兰奇先生吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that Mr. Strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.19,0:25:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是斯特兰奇博士 梅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Strange, May. Doctor Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.19,0:25:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不知道那是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, no, I don't know who that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.81,0:25:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是个新来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a new guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.89,0:25:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想帮他 但... - 哈皮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was trying to help him, but... - Happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.29,0:25:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的午餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's my lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.49,0:26:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,别吃那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't eat that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.49,0:26:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哈皮也在吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.75,0:26:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是哈皮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's Happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.06,0:26:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这儿 来做志工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here. He came by to volunteer.
