Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.09,0:26:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他想跟你打个招呼 - 我不想... 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And he wants to say hi. - I don't want... Hi, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.02,0:26:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哈皮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.36,0:26:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我忙呢 我得送个传单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I'm working hard here. I gotta do a... a leaflet drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.09,0:26:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么... - 很高兴你玩得开心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing in... - Glad you're having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.16,0:26:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我会照顾好你婶婶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, I'm really taking care of your aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.12,0:26:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你的计划怎么样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how's the plan going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.75,0:26:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是遭遇了些挫折{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been setbacks, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.75,0:26:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别想太多 相信直觉就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't over think it, just trust your instincts, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.32,0:26:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 爱你 再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. Love you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.75,0:26:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那人是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.95,0:26:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他就像钢铁侠和托尔的集合体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's Iron Man and Thor rolled into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.42,0:26:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他还行吧 他可不比蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all right. He's no Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.89,0:26:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么这么痴迷于蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it with you and Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.56,0:26:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 他很赞的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? He's just awesome, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.75,0:26:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他保护本地社区 很激励人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He protects the neighborhood and, you know, he's inspiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.06,0:26:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他激励我做个更好的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He inspires me to be a better man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.25,0:26:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 蠢蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up, dickwad?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.69,0:26:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你淹死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.12,0:27:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看来他名叫神秘客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like his name's Mysterio.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.09,0:27:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"L'uomo del misterio"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.56,0:27:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是意大利语"神秘男子"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is Italian for "Man of mystery."
