Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.49,0:27:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,神秘客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mysterio.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.92,0:27:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,名字不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.89,0:27:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.16,0:27:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了多少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how much of that did you actually see?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.09,0:27:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没看到多少 我忙着跑呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not much. I was running.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.09,0:27:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我也是 我也忙着跑呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Me too. I was also running...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.29,0:27:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,跑远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.02,0:27:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,明天去巴黎了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Paris tomorrow.
