Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.99,0:27:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我读到它建造的秘密目的是作为头脑控制天线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I read it was secretly built as a mind control antenna
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.89,0:27:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,以制造疯子大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to create an army of the insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.95,0:27:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所以那里是我整趟旅行最喜欢的目的地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why it's my favorite destination on the whole trip.
