Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.29,0:27:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不做什么 它死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. It's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.79,0:27:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,再说 那个神秘客都搞定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, that Mysterio guy's all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.09,0:27:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想跟MJ一起玩玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I just wanna spend time with MJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.95,0:27:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚刚聊起巴黎 我觉得她是喜欢我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were talking about Paris, and I think she really likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.62,0:27:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,让我想起了我和贝蒂刚相爱时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reminds me of when Betty and I first fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.45,0:27:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚吃完我的水果馅饼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had just finished my fruit cobbler, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.99,0:28:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,联系你可真不容易 蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a very difficult person to contact, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.95,0:28:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你是尼克·弗瑞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Nick Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.99,0:28:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你射晕了内德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you just shot Ned.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.59,0:28:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,只是温和的麻醉剂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a mild tranquilizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.25,0:28:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴终于见到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So good to finally meet you.
