Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.59,0:28:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得当时不是交换号码的好时机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I didn't think that was a good time to exchange numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.62,0:28:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 那就太不合适了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that would've been really inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.45,0:28:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不就这么说的吗 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what I just said. - Right.
