Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.79,0:28:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,都敢不接我电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is dodging my calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what I do know:
