Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.99,0:29:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,三天后 摩洛哥发生类似事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days later, a similar event in Morocco.
