Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.32,0:29:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看看经历了今天的创伤性事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if anyone needs any emotional counseling
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.09,0:29:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是否有人需要情感咨询{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after today's traumatic events.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.95,0:29:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们没事的 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we'll be okay. We're fine. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.49,0:29:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 因为我其实没资格做...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great because I'm... I'm not qualified to actually...
