Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.45,0:29:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我老师 抱歉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my teacher. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚刚在说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.72,0:29:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一个村庄被摧毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A village was destroyed by
