Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.24,0:30:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们俩有谁开始呕吐要告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me know if either of you develop vomiting.
