Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.86,0:30:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.99,0:30:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"欲戴王冠 必承其重"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Uneasy lies the head that wears the crown."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.66,0:30:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克说你不会懂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark said you wouldn't get that
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.12,0:30:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,因为不是《星战》梗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it's not a Star Wars reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.16,0:30:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,摘了面罩吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can lose the mask.
