Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.45,0:30:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,装神秘 还要隔着布料呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and breathing through spandex for no good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.45,0:30:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.42,0:30:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.99,0:30:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那是玛丽亚·希尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there, we have Maria Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.42,0:31:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是德米崔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is Dimitri.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.89,0:31:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是贝克先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is Mr. Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.52,0:31:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,神秘客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mysterio?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.05,0:31:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.89,0:31:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.86,0:31:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友这么喊你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what my friends have been calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.09,0:31:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以喊我昆廷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you can call me Quentin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.99,0:31:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天的表现真出色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You handled yourself well out there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.86,0:31:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你拉着那座钟塔了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw what you did with the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.39,0:31:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的世界就需要你这种人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could use someone like you on my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.52,0:31:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.19,0:31:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Your world?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.55,0:31:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克先生是来自地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Beck is from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.39,0:31:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是你的地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.05,0:31:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,现实有很多个 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are multiple realities, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.86,0:31:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是616号地球 我来自833号地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Earth Dimension 616. I'm from Earth 833.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.79,0:31:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你是说存在多元宇宙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, you're saying there's a multiverse?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.09,0:31:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为那只是个理论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I thought that was just theoretical.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.52,0:31:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这将完全改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that completely changes
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.59,0:31:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对初始奇点的理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how we understand the initial singularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.12,0:31:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是个永恒膨胀的系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking about an eternal inflation system.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.99,0:31:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那怎么行得通 那么多量...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does that even work with all the quantum...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.95,0:31:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真是疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.36,0:31:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 好酷啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S-sorry. It's really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.66,0:31:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不要为比其他人聪明而道歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ever apologize for being the smartest one in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.25,0:32:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.05,0:32:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,它们诞生于黑洞中的稳定轨道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were born in stable orbits within black holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.92,0:32:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是基本元素构成的生灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creatures formed from the primary elements:
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.19,0:32:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,气 水 火 土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air, water, fire, earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.79,0:32:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,科学部为它们起了学名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Science Division had a technical name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.32,0:32:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们喊它们元素怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just called them Elementals.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.89,0:32:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的变体普遍存在于我们的神话中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Versions of them exist across our mythologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.36,0:32:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,原来传说都是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out, the myths are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.09,0:32:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就像托尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.82,0:32:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,托尔原是传说 但现在是我物理课的内容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor was a myth, and now I study him in my physics class.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.19,0:32:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这些传说是威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These myths are threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.92,0:32:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,它们最初于多年前在我的地球上实体化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They first materialized on my Earth many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.25,0:32:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们调动力量与它们交手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We mobilized and fought them,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.75,0:32:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但它们随着每场战斗愈发强大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but with each battle, they grew, got stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.45,0:32:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我是仅剩的最后一支阻止它们的军团的一员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was part of the last battalion left trying to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.75,0:32:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们只推迟了不可避免的结局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we did was delay the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.69,0:32:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,元素怪又来到了这里 袭击相同的地点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Elementals are here now, attacking the same coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.09,0:32:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星已证实了这点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our satellites confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.36,0:32:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所以感谢贝克先生摧毁了另三个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So thank Mr. Beck for destroying the other three.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.09,0:32:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只剩一个了 火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one left: fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.42,0:32:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,它们中最强的一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The strongest of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.45,0:32:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁了我的地球的那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one that destroyed my Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.99,0:32:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,也是杀死我家人的那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the one that took my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.36,0:33:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.72,0:33:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,再过大概48小时 它就会出现在布拉格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it will be in Prague in approximately 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.39,0:33:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只有一项任务 干掉它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have one mission: kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.36,0:33:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你要跟我们一起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.49,0:33:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你是说布拉格吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, did you say Prague?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.02,0:33:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,弗瑞先生 这似乎是很严重的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Fury, this all seems like bigtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.42,0:33:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,很重大的 超级英雄的那种事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, huge superhero kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.12,0:33:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是友好邻居蜘蛛侠 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, I mean, I'm just a friendly neighborhood Spider-Man, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.72,0:33:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,少来了 你上过太空呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch, please. You've been to space.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.59,0:33:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 但那是意外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but that was an accident.
