Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.22,0:33:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 托尔呢 - 去别的世界了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about Thor? - Off-world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.16,0:33:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 斯特兰奇博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, um, Doctor Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.02,0:33:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没空 - 惊奇队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unavailable. - Captain Marvel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.72,0:33:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我提她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't invoke her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.95,0:33:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我真的想帮忙的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, look, I really wanna help. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.22,0:33:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我婶婶得知我离开了大部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if my aunt finds out I left my class trip,
