Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.89,0:33:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,经过了华盛顿纪念堂的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I'm seen like this in Europe
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.19,0:33:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我再这样在欧洲出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after the Washington Monument,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.25,0:33:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我全班同学都会猜到我的身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my whole class will figure out who I am, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.99,0:33:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那全世界就都知道我的身份了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the whole world will figure out who I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.49,0:33:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我就完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.89,0:33:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.31,0:33:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.05,0:33:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.12,0:33:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你快回去吧 别被老师发现你不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you get back before your teachers miss you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.09,0:34:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,起了疑心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and become suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.79,0:34:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,德米崔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dimitri.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.09,0:34:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,带他回旅馆去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him back to the hotel, please.
