Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.99,0:34:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好 回见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.05,0:34:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见 女士 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye, ma'am. - Yeah.
