Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.96,0:41:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我... - 是啊 奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I... - Yeah. Weird.
