Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.40,0:57:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么 彼得·帕克 就现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want? You, Peter Parker. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.97,0:57:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.77,0:57:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我想去旅我的行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna go on my trip, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.67,0:57:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想回去跟朋友们一起旅行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to go back on my trip with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.24,0:58:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我喜欢的姑娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And go to the top of the Eiffel Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.31,0:58:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,去埃菲尔铁塔顶层 然后向她告白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the girl who I really like and tell her how I feel, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.44,0:58:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,吻她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give her a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.57,0:58:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.77,0:58:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会那么做 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna do that, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.94,0:58:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能 - 为什么不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I can't. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.71,0:58:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我还有太多责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I have too much of a responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.21,0:58:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊 非常感谢 - 那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God. Thank you so much. - What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.40,0:58:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是... - 伊迪丝眼镜 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are those the... - EDITH glasses, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.21,0:58:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,之前掉地上了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were just on the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.44,0:58:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,戴上试试 让我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try them on. Let's see how they look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.84,0:58:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.71,0:58:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我还挺喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually really like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.57,0:58:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我能跟你说实话吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I be completely honest with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.04,0:58:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,请吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.40,0:58:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,丑爆了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look really stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.81,0:58:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但或许还有隐形眼镜版本的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But maybe they have a contact-lens version.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.07,0:58:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你戴上试试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You try them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.24,0:58:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 得了 - 试试嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, come on. - Try them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.17,0:58:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不想戴 - 戴上试试嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't wanna try them on. - Just put them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.97,0:58:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.27,0:59:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"下一个托尼·斯塔克 我信任你"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Next Tony Stark, I trust you."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.47,0:59:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"给下一个托尼·斯塔克 我信任你"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"For the next Tony Stark, I trust you."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.00,0:59:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.49,0:59:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生给我留下眼镜时还有段话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Stark left me a message with those glasses:
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.14,0:59:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"给下一个托尼·斯塔克 我信任你"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"For the next Tony Stark, I trust you."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.43,0:59:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是不懂 你喝了几杯柠檬汁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still not following. How many lemonades have you had?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.99,0:59:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道我犯过的每个错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knew every mistake I ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.79,0:59:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定也知道我还没做好这个准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, he must've known that I wasn't ready for something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.79,0:59:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那他为什么要把眼镜给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would he give it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.95,0:59:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,因为或许他不是把伊迪丝托付给了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because maybe he didn't trust me to have EDITH,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.56,0:59:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而是托付我选个应该拥有它的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he just trusted me to pick who should.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.80,0:59:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这要合理多了 他一向知道我会做正确选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes much more sense. He always knew I'd do what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.29,0:59:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会把眼镜给弗瑞的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's not gonna give them to Fury
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.42,0:59:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,因为弗瑞只会自己留着伊迪丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because Fury would give himself EDITH.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.93,0:59:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这你八成是说对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're probably right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.22,0:59:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 所以世界需要下一个钢铁侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, so the world needs the next Iron Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.66,0:59:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那不会是我的 我是个皇后区来的16岁孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's not me. I mean, I'm a 16-year-old kid from Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.64,0:59:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,得是个大人 有经验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It needs to be an adult with some experience
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.61,0:59:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就像托尼·斯塔克一样好 比如你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's good like Tony Stark, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.62,0:59:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不 彼得 得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Peter, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.25,0:59:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.13,0:59:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伊迪丝 - 你好 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- EDITH? - Hello, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.03,0:59:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.11,0:59:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我想把你的控制权交给昆廷·贝克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to transfer your control over to Quentin Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.26,0:59:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 彼得 你干什么呢 - 做正确的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peter, what are you doing? - Doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.06,1:00:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,移交控制权需要确认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any transfer will require confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.46,1:00:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克把眼镜给了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark gave you the glasses.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.20,1:00:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克给了我个选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark gave me a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.28,1:00:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我要做的选择 我现在要选了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my choice to make. Okay? I'm gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.38,1:00:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个士兵 是领袖 你阻止了元素怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you're a soldier, a leader. You stopped the Elementals.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.19,1:00:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你救了我 救了世界 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved my life. You saved the world, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.16,1:00:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他会希望你拿着眼镜的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd want you to have them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.80,1:00:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等待确认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting for confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.49,1:00:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,确认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirm.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.46,1:00:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入复仇者联盟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the Avengers.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.32,1:00:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你戴挺帅的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look good on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.19,1:00:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.65,1:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,很荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.50,1:00:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.76,1:00:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生真的会喜欢你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark would've really liked you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.22,1:00:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去哪 - 去找MJ{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where you headed? - I'm gonna go find MJ.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.90,1:00:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运 孩子 我觉得你有一半机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, kid. I'll give you about a fifty-fifty chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.39,1:00:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你挺别扭的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're pretty awkward. So...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.81,1:00:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.41,1:00:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回见了 - 回见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you later, man. - See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.65,1:01:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 并不难吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? That wasn't so hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.45,1:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.49,1:01:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谁帮我褪下这身破戏服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody get this stupid costume off me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.93,1:01:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们拿到伊迪丝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we got EDITH.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.82,1:01:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个连上我们的系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get these connected to our system.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.79,1:01:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,敬酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toast! Toast! Toast!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.05,1:01:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是场重大胜利 但我们的任务还很艰巨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this is a big win, but we still got a lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.27,1:01:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,敬酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toast! Toast! Toast!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.97,1:01:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.52,1:01:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 敬一杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, toasts!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.08,1:01:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,给我 道格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that, Doug.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.88,1:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,敬让我们走到一起的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the man who brought us all together,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.34,1:01:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的前老板 托尼·斯塔克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our former boss, Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.98,1:02:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The jester king.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.65,1:02:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,被财富和科技包裹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Literally wrapped in wealth and technology
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.01,1:02:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他却不配使用它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he was unfit to wield.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.49,1:02:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我设计的全息系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the holographic system I designed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.28,1:02:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那是革命性的突破{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A revolutionary breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.88,1:02:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有无限的应用前景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with limitless applications
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.20,1:02:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,却被托尼变成了自我治疗机器 还改名叫...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Tony turned into a self-therapy machine and renamed...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.53,1:02:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,二进制增强记忆重塑工具 简称"二重"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Binarily Augmented Retro-Framing, or BARF.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.28,1:02:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我这个治疗实验花费了6.11亿美元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$611 million for my little therapeutic experiment.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.71,1:02:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我的毕生心血改名叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He renamed my life's work...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.82,1:02:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"二重"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Barf."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.10,1:02:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我对他说这是个错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him it was a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.31,1:02:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的科技可以改变世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that my technology could change the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.08,1:02:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,然后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.22,1:02:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他解雇了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he fired me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.77,1:02:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,说我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said I was...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.65,1:02:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不稳定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.69,1:02:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,敬托尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.57,1:02:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,敬托尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.11,1:02:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来 敬威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next, to William.
