Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.08,1:02:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼·斯塔克在一个山洞里就造成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony Stark was able to build this in a cave!
