Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.54,1:03:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我的幻景科技和你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The integration of my illusion tech
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.39,1:03:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,武器化无人机的结合简直绝妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with your weaponized drones was brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.79,1:03:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,强大幻景 真实摧毁 屡试不爽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Powerful illusions, real damage, worked like a charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.52,1:03:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,而这还只是开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.70,1:03:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 兄弟 - 敬古特曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, brother. - To Guterman.
