Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.07,1:03:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你编写的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The story you created
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.18,1:03:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一个来自另一个地球的战士昆廷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a soldier from another Earth named Quentin
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.00,1:03:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在欧洲跟太空怪物战斗 简直荒谬至极{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fighting space monsters in Europe is totally ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.37,1:03:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可看来现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and apparently exactly the kind of thing
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.84,1:03:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,大家就信这一套了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people would believe right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.18,1:03:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都信了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, everybody bought it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.79,1:03:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 古特 - 古特曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gutes! - Guterman!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.52,1:03:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 敬维多利亚 - 敬维多利亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To Victoria. - To Victoria!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.51,1:03:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在每个袭击点制造电磁脉冲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Staging electromagnetic pulses at each attack site
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.75,1:03:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让弗瑞的卫星确认我们的谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so Fury's own satellites would confirm our lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.27,1:03:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好点子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspired idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.13,1:03:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 敬詹妮丝 - 詹妮丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To Janice. - Janice!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.09,1:03:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼死后 是她发现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After Tony died, she was the one who discovered that
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.43,1:03:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,伊迪丝没有被交给我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}EDITH was being handed over not to us,
