Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.70,1:03:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 敬詹妮丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - To Janice!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.47,1:03:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也敬你们其他人 托尼·斯塔克死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to the rest of you, Tony Stark is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.26,1:03:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有个机会 会有人站出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a window of opportunity, and someone will step up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.47,1:03:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但现如今 哪怕你是在场最聪明的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these days, you can be the smartest guy in the room,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.91,1:03:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,最有资质的人 也没人在乎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most qualified, and no one cares.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.47,1:03:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你披着斗篷飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you're flying around with a cape
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.22,1:03:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,或是手能发出激光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or shooting lasers from your hands,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.05,1:04:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,否则根本没人听你说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no one will even listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.54,1:04:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在有斗篷和激光了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've got a cape and lasers.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.98,1:04:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,凭借我们的科技 和伊迪丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With our technology and with EDITH,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.15,1:04:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,神秘客将成为地球上最伟大的英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mysterio will be the greatest hero on Earth!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.06,1:04:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.33,1:04:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,到时所有人都得听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then everyone will listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.81,1:04:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不是听一个酗酒的巨婴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to a boozy man-child.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.81,1:04:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.45,1:04:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是听一个青春期少年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to a hormonal teenager.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.00,1:04:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.25,1:04:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,而是听我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To me...
