Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.06,1:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,敬我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.92,1:04:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,敬我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.00,1:04:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,敬神秘客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Mysterio!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.46,1:04:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,敬神秘客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Mysterio!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.31,1:04:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,敬彼得·帕克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.47,1:04:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,敬彼得·帕克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Peter Parker!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.36,1:04:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.12,1:04:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们开工吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get to work.
