Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.01,1:05:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哥们 旅行结束了 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dude, the trip's over. - What?
