Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.30,1:05:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的家长当然会叫我们回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course our parents would want us home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.75,1:05:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,请别让我待机 彼得 你没死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't put me on hold. Peter, you're not dead.
