Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.22,1:05:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别... 去换身衣服 我们在订飞机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't... Put some clothes on. We're booking flights.
