Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.15,1:05:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 我们一早就回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is going on, dude? - We're going home in the morning.
