Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.90,1:05:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 内德 - 来了 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ned. - Coming, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.82,1:05:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们能小点声吗 我在直播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you guys keep it down? I'm live-streaming.
