Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.38,1:05:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们担心你来着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.79,1:05:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好你回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good thing you're back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.56,1:05:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.01,1:05:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,巴黎去不成了 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much for Paris, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.59,1:05:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,本会很好玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would've been fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.75,1:05:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.16,1:05:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night.
