Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.27,1:07:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们在欧洲的最后一晚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our last night in Europe,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.71,1:07:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个计划 我想告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I had this plan that I wanted to tell you.
