Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.65,1:07:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"我是蜘蛛侠"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'm Spider-Man."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.57,1:07:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 那是你想说的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - That's what you were gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.00,1:07:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you're Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.85,1:07:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不是蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm not Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.30,1:07:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我观察你好一阵了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I've been watching you for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.01,1:07:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,挺明显的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kind of obvious.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.51,1:07:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not Spider-Man.
