Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.29,1:08:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你突然之间毫无原因地不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact that you disappear out of nowhere for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.09,1:08:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我病了 记得吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I was sick. Remember?
