Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.00,1:08:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,苏珊·杨以为你是个男妓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Susan Yang thinks you're a male escort.
