Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.97,1:08:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就是蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you're Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.05,1:08:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 我才不是蜘蛛侠 - 那今晚呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I'm not Spider-Man at all. - What about tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.27,1:08:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你溜出去 跟那怪物打斗 我看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You snuck off and you fought that thing. I saw you.
