Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.97,1:08:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而且新闻上说那是夜猴侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And also, on the news, it was the Night Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.85,1:08:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 夜猴侠 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Night Monkey? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.19,1:08:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,新闻上那么说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what it said on the news,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.34,1:08:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,新闻从不撒谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the news never lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.85,1:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,夜猴侠 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night Monkey. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.93,1:08:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.76,1:08:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,夜猴侠和蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, do the Night Monkey and Spider-Man
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.43,1:08:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,用一样的网吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}use the same webs?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.39,1:08:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,或许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.01,1:08:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他是只蜘蛛猿 谁知道呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's a Spider Monkey. Who knows?
