Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.76,1:08:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.91,1:08:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,要不然我为什么要看你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why else would I be watching you?
