Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.00,1:09:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.34,1:09:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么投影仪吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, like some kind of projector or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.13,1:09:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但非常先进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but it's really advanced.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.73,1:09:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去好真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It... It looked so real.
