Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.07,1:09:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 那么说... - 元素怪是假的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, does that mean that... - The Elementals are fake?
