Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.65,1:10:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- MJ - 那你为什么在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- MJ... - So why are you here?
