Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.96,1:10:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,MJ 我知道你有千万个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MJ, look, I know you have a lot of questions,
