Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.30,1:10:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好 真不敢相信我猜到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay. I can't believe I figured it out!
