Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.14,1:10:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.60,1:10:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可以快进到最后吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, can you just fast-forward to the end?
