Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.70,1:11:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要武器化吗 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want to weaponize? - Yep.
