Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.61,1:11:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 时间没问题吧 - 没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We on schedule? - Oh, yeah.
