Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.96,1:12:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那会死伤惨重的 - 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's gonna cause a lot of casualties. - Oh, yeah.
