Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.91,1:12:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去迎接胜利 - 没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- for the victory lap? - Of course.
