Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.67,1:12:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就一台无人机 图像不会有问题的 我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one drone. The image will be perfect, I promise.
