Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.55,1:30:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是你们的大巴 - 我们有自己的大巴呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- this is your bus. - We got a bus all to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.04,1:30:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你们很高兴 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to see you all. Come along.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.21,1:30:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我吧 好 - 走吧 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll get this, yeah? Why not? - Let's go. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.34,1:30:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Thank you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.34,1:30:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.21,1:31:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们接到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.93,1:31:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽快赶过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got here as fast as I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.31,1:31:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我把周边扫了一遍 没有发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did a full perimeter sweep. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.91,1:31:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.30,1:31:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,脉冲在激增{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pulse is spiking.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.52,1:31:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我再去看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take another look.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.46,1:31:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你一看到什么 马上报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon as you see something, report.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.10,1:31:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只剩你了 贝克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all we've got, Beck.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.33,1:31:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是我担心的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is what I fear,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.56,1:31:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那上帝保佑我们了 弗瑞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then God help us, Fury.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.17,1:31:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑我们所有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God help us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.82,1:31:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 没有复仇者来 我们可以开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, people, no Avengers coming. We're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.95,1:31:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 威廉 启动无人机 - 收到 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- William, launch the drones. - Copy that, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.79,1:31:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,无人机进入大气层 武器就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drones are entering the atmosphere weapons-hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.93,1:31:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好 詹妮丝 - 还在熨斗篷呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excellent. Janice? - Still working on the cape.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.19,1:31:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,把褶子都熨平了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta get those wrinkles out.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.14,1:31:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,再过几小时 我真可能要跟女王握手了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a few hours, I could literally be shaking hands with the queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.31,1:31:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 古特曼 - 马上就位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guterman? - Almost in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.93,1:31:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 来吧 维多利亚 - 增强脉冲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. Hit it, Victoria. - Increasing pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.45,1:31:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever this thing is,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.41,1:31:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,它比之前的强100倍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's 100 times bigger than the previous ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.61,1:31:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,伊迪丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edith?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.97,1:31:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是 昆廷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Quentin.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.75,1:32:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我要处理的麻烦在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me my loose ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.12,1:32:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,节目一开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once the show's going,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.11,1:32:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就等我命令执行击杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}execute the kill order on my command.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.01,1:32:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Copy. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.14,1:32:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,节目开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start the show.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.39,1:32:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来拯救世界吧 各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's save the world, people.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.70,1:32:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这情况 绝对有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like this. Something's definitely up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.50,1:32:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在是蛛友了 "蜘蛛侠的朋友"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an FOS now. "Friend of Spider-Man."
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.69,1:32:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你得记住 保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have to remember, just stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.35,1:32:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 那看上去不妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, that doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.97,1:32:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但那是假的 所以不必担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's fake, so, there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.24,1:32:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们进入击杀区了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the kids are in the kill zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.23,1:32:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 古特曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great work, Guterman.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.42,1:32:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干什么 - 我是哈皮 哈皮·霍根{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Happy here. Happy Hogan here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.45,1:32:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 你有什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.60,1:32:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生那边在整理东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over at Mr. Stark's, going through his belongings.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.55,1:32:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你似乎留下了一块冲浪板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently there was a surfboard you left behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.87,1:32:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 那边的人说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - People over there said
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.13,1:32:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克·弗瑞不像冲浪的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they didn't think Nick Fury was a surfer,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.56,1:32:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但我说 "人不可貌相"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I said, "Appearances can be deceiving."
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.74,1:32:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我的 永远别再打这个号码了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not mine. And don't ever call this number again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.57,1:33:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好 弗瑞听懂暗语了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Fury's got the coded message.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.25,1:33:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的朋友在塔桥上 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your friends are at the Tower Bridge. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.94,1:33:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你朋友说是伦敦桥 但我还是猜出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your boy called it London Bridge, but I figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.12,1:33:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去接他们 好吗 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna go scoop them up, okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.35,1:33:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们快到了 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're close. - We're close.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.41,1:33:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 战衣怎么样了 - 快好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's the suit coming? - Almost done.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.85,1:33:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good. - Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.99,1:33:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你走之前 如果我出事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you go, if something happens to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.82,1:33:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以把这个给MJ吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could you please give this to MJ?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.80,1:33:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你能安全回来的 到时你自己给她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are gonna make it back. You'll give it to her yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.01,1:33:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你行的 - 我行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay? You got this. - I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.39,1:33:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟我说一遍 - 他们用的是幻景科技{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Walk me through it. - I know it's illusion tech, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.32,1:33:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要进入幻景内部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I do is get on the inside of the illusion,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.36,1:33:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能击垮它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then I can take it down,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.41,1:33:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,找到他 而他只是个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}find him, and he's just a guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.97,1:33:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以把伊迪丝夺回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I can take EDITH right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.51,1:33:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好 但上次 你被火车撞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, but last time, you got hit by a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.33,1:33:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但这次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True, but this time...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.92,1:33:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么解释呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I explain this?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.74,1:33:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我有种第六感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a sixth sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.34,1:33:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得一激灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Peter-tingle.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.47,1:33:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说那个吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you're talking about, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.90,1:33:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在不灵了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not working, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.90,1:33:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说现在不灵了 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard it wasn't working right now. Is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.00,1:33:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,灵的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is working.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.78,1:33:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道灵不灵... - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know if it's working... - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.26,1:33:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好 你有彼得一激灵 这就是你的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. You got the Peter-tingle. That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.30,1:33:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我去接你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go get your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.64,1:33:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你让你的彼得一激灵重新上线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get that Peter-tingle back online.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.17,1:33:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.66,1:34:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,闪电开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cue the lightning.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.00,1:34:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,闪电开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cuing lightning.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.73,1:34:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 上面还安全吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, is it still safe on the top,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.52,1:34:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还是我们该下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or should we all come down?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.97,1:34:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.82,1:34:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大巴司机怎么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did the bus driver say?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.05,1:34:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大巴司机不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bus driver's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.84,1:34:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 去哪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.20,1:34:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 戴尔老师和我能控制局面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. Mr. Dell and I have it under control!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.02,1:34:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别把我拉进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Don't drag me into this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.95,1:34:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经尽力了 朱利亚斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing my best, Julius!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.59,1:34:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听着 - 又是巫术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look... - Oh, the witches are back.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.74,1:34:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 快下车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, get off the bus!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.47,1:34:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好 跟我来 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, follow me, kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.39,1:34:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,来 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.74,1:35:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是复仇者级别的威胁呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that is an Avengers-level threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.12,1:35:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way. This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.82,1:35:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. Okay. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.49,1:35:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 弗拉士 - 跟着手走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Flash! - Follow that hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.11,1:35:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这边走 跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.98,1:35:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这都不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not real, it's not real!
