Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.36,2:07:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也帮忙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We helped.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.02,2:07:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 塔罗斯 - 得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Talos. - Come off it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.22,2:07:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么可能知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was I supposed to know
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.97,2:07:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,整件事都是假的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the whole thing was fake?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.85,2:07:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那都太像模像样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that was all very, very convincing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.21,2:07:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,表演 幻景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The performances, the illusion,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.98,2:07:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,戏服 手工真不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that costume, the craftsmanship in that.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.97,2:07:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这对于变形人来说太丢人了 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, this is just embarrassing for a shape-shifter. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.85,2:07:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 希望你的任务还顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey there. I hope your mission is going well.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.41,2:08:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一周前照你说的把眼镜给了帕克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gave the glasses to Parker about a week ago, like you said.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.09,2:08:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,场面很感人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was very touching, you know?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.70,2:08:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很感人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, really quite touching.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.50,2:08:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,塔罗斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talos.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.95,2:08:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在之后不久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, you know, shortly after that,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.49,2:08:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都失控了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it really kind of went off the rails,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.09,2:08:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we need you to come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.40,2:08:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,因为大家都在问复仇者联盟在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause, everyone kept asking where the Avengers are,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.59,2:08:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我又不知道该怎么回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to say to that,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.90,2:08:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好蜘蛛侠赢...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you're lucky that Spider-Man won...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.53,2:08:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,都回去工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody back to work!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.75,2:08:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我的鞋谁拿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's got my shoes?
